Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:21.03,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx107\fscy157\pos(369.6,739.6)\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,0)}印度尼西亚 雅加达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:21.03,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx71\fscy114\pos(283.2,808.4)\c&Hf0f5f5\fad(500,0)}2003年9月24日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:11.37,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}我很抱歉 打搅了您的午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:14.42,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,不必道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:17.50,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我快吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:23.72,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,警官先生 请容我问一句
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:26.66,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我犯了什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:27.43,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.39,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,您当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:33.64,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,那您找对人了吗——？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:35.56,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,您是拉特那女士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:37.35,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,真菌学教授
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:39.71,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,工作单位 印度尼西亚大学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:43.44,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我们要找的正是您
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.99,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&H1a4a73\3c&H070907\4c&H070907\pos(1372.8,1027.6)\fscx97\fscy127}印度尼西亚共和国\N卫生部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:26.97,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,230,,拉特那女士 您可否看一看我们制好的标本？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:29.11,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,您可能会注意到——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.55,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,让她自己得出结论吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:57.20,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,这是线虫草真菌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:03:00.62,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,载玻片上怎么还加了氯唑？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:05.38,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,230,,因为样本是从人体上采集到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:13.60,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,线虫草真菌不可能在人体内存活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.93,0:03:35.03,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,如果您感到不适
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:37.54,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,就马上离开停尸间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:10.17,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,看她的左腿底下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:49.40,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,咬她的是人类吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:56.36,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,什么时候发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.66,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,大概30小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:05:59.83,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,在哪儿发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:04.20,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,230,,城西边的一家面粉加工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:07.75,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,真是理想的培养基
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:12.32,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,后来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:16.84,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,一个正常妇女 突然出现暴力行为
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:19.14,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,她攻击了四位同事 咬伤其中三人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:23.06,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,他们把她锁在卫生间里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:26.73,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,警察赶来后 她又试图攻击警察
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:29.40,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,警察朝她开了枪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:34.88,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,被她咬伤的那些人怎样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.28,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,他们被带走并进行观察
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:41.01,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,几小时后……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:45.35,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我们不得不按照规定 采取必要措施
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:48.71,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,处决了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:53.84,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,谁咬的“她”？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:58.53,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我们不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:07:02.30,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,所以 外面还有感染者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:08.27,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,还有其他工人失踪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:12.48,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,有十四人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:24.56,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,拉特那女士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:30.33,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我们请您来 是希望您能协助我们 防止事态恶化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:34.04,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我们需要疫苗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.17,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,或者特效药
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:52.83,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我这一生都在研究真菌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:58.05,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,请您认真听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:00.70,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,没有特效药
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:04.22,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,也没有疫苗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:10.06,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:23.86,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:27.91,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,用炸弹轰炸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:32.08,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,轰炸这座城市……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:36.84,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,炸死所有居民
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.83,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:58.57,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,您能派人送我回家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:07.64,Subtitle-TLOU-JAVA,,0,0,0,,我想和家人待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:15.00,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(601.6,440.4)}最后
