Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:15.00,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(1425.6,717.2)}第一季
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:15.00,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(2200,1000)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\pos(1480,995.6)}第二集
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:17.96,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(800,800)\fscx337\fscy562\c&Ha4b1d2\alpha&H1E&\an7\pos(796.8,291.6)}{\fs64}感染\N{\fs32}Infected
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:30.60,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hbfbfbf\alpha&H19&\fs48\fad(500,500)\pos(542.4,1006.8)}翻译\N{\fs64}{\b1}叽拇啾＆疾火
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.10,Character-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(248,864.4)}{\b1}艾莉·威廉姆斯{\b0}\N{\fs44}波士顿生还者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:48.91,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H19&\fad(500,500)\fs48\pos(960,1011.6)\c&Hbfbfbf}精校＆后期＆监制\N{\fs64}{\b1}北落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:57.04,Character-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(624,499.6)}{\b1}乔尔·米勒{\b0}\N{\fs44}波士顿走私者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:57.04,Character-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1376,552.4)}{\b1}泰丝·瑟沃普勒斯{\b0}\N{\fs44}波士顿走私者\N乔尔的搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fs50}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:13.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看起来像是被感染了吗？\N{\fs50}Do I look like I'm infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把你的胳膊露出来\N{\fs50}Show us your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:25.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行啊 我的伤口没恶化 不是吗？\N{\fs50}Yeah, it's not getting any worse, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:30.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我们现在身处外城 为什么感染者没有蜂拥而至？\N{\fs50}If we're out in the open city, why aren't we getting swarmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:31.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这你别操心了\N{\fs50}Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:32.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我已经在操心了\N{\fs50}Well, I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:35.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳想拿这个被感染的孩子做什么？\N{\fs50}What was Marlene doing with an infected kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没被感染\N{\fs50}I'm not infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在我被咬之后 她发现了我\N{\fs50}She found me after I was bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她没朝你开枪\N{\fs50}And she didn't shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:43.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,显而易见\N{\fs50}Clearly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:46.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她把我关了起来 派人每天检查我的情况\N{\fs50}She locked me up and had her guys test me every day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:47.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,判断我是不是病了\N{\fs50}to see if I was getting sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:48.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么检查你的？\N{\fs50}Test you how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:49.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要尿尿\N{\fs50}I have to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:52.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们检查你 怎么检查？\N{\fs50}Test you, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:54.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们让我数到十 还要我伸出手\N{\fs50}They'd make me count to 10 and hold out my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:55.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把手稳在空中\N{\fs50}and then keep it steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:57.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是吧 我觉得最让他们感到惊异的\N{\fs50}But, you know, I think what really impressed them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:00.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是我没变成他妈的怪物\N{\fs50}was the fact that I didn't turn into a fucking monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能走了吗？\N{\fs50}Now can I please?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去你身后的房间 随便找个角落\N{\fs50}Back there. You can find a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:16.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,接着\N{\fs50}And here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,撕几页下来\N{\fs50}Tear out a few pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:23.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不会有什么坏家伙在那里等着我吧\N{\fs50}There's not gonna be anything bad in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:24.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就你而已\N{\fs50}Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哦 真好笑\N{\fs50}Oh, funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的手伤了\N{\fs50}Broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:43.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,估计是轻微骨折 很快就好\N{\fs50}Maybe a hairline. It'll heal fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:53.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他妈的一整晚她都撑过去了 乔尔\N{\fs50}She made it through the fuckin' night, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fs50}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她迟早会变异\N{\fs50}It's gonna happen sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白吗？我们离隔离墙还不算远\N{\fs50}All right? We're still close to the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以把她偷渡回隔离区\N{\fs50}We sneak her back into the QZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:03.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再想其他的办法拿到电池\N{\fs50}We find a different way to get the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:05.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是我们最好的机会了\N{\fs50}This is our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:10.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们把她带回隔离区 总会有人注意到她的胳膊\N{\fs50}We take her back to the QZ, someone's gonna notice her arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:13.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,扫描她的伤口 然后杀了她\N{\fs50}they're gonna scan her, then they'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:14.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那也总好过由我们动手\N{\fs50}Well, better them then us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:16.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别再说得好像这个孩子\N{\fs50}You need to stop talkin' about this kid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:19.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有一线生机似的\N{\fs50}like she's got some kinda life in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:31.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你饿吗？\N{\fs50}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:33.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以分你些吃的\N{\fs50}You can share some of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢了 玛琳给我带了食物\N{\fs50}Thanks. Marlene sent me with my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:55.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你吃的是鸡肉？\N{\fs50}Is that chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:57.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳说这是从走私贩那里弄来的\N{\fs50}Marlene said they get it from smugglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜不是你俩\N{\fs50}Guess not you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:08.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿！\N{\fs50}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:09.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什——\N{\fs50}Why--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:11.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么玛琳这么看重你？\N{\fs50}why are you so important to Marlene?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别撒谎 不然我们就带你回去\N{\fs50}And don't lie to me or we'll take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:16.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们把我带回去 那就拿不到电池了\N{\fs50}You take me back, you don't get your battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:18.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你听到我们说话了吧？\N{\fs50}You heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你一定也听到他想要开枪毙了你\N{\fs50}Then you must've heard that he wants to shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:30.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以对待成年人的方式来和你说话\N{\fs50}I'm gonna talk to you like you're an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:31.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吗？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:33.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔和我不是什么好人\N{\fs50}Joel and I aren't good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们接这个活 是为了自己\N{\fs50}We're doin' this for us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为 很明显 你对某些人有价值\N{\fs50}because, apparently, you're worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:41.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是 我们如果不知道你是怎么回事 就没办法弄清你的价值\N{\fs50}But we don't know what you're worth if we don't know what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:44.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 来回答我的问题\N{\fs50}So answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她不让我告诉别人\N{\fs50}She told me not to tell anybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:56.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我现在是第一次跟其他人——\N{\fs50}and now I'm telling the first people that I--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:04.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在西边某个地方 有个火萤基地\N{\fs50}There's a Firefly base camp somewhere out west,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:06.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们有医生\N{\fs50}with doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:08.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在研究解药\N{\fs50}They're working on a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:09.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也听过这些传闻\N{\fs50}I've heard this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:11.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不管我身上发生了什么 那都是找到疫苗的关键\N{\fs50}And whatever happened to me, is the key to finding the vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,仅仅如此吗？\N{\fs50}That's what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:15.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这话我们听过不下百万次了\N{\fs50}We've heard this a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:18.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,疫苗 灵丹妙药 没一个有用的 都一个样\N{\fs50}Vaccines, miracle cures. None of it works. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:19.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操你妈 又不是我想提的\N{\fs50}Fuck you, man. I didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:20.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也没想问你\N{\fs50}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:23.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这事没什么好结果 泰丝\N{\fs50}This isn't gonna end well, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们得往回走\N{\fs50}We need to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我们把这票干完\N{\fs50}Let's just finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:37.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她是否真如火萤所说 那不重要\N{\fs50}It doesn't matter if she is or she isn't what the Fireflies say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:40.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只要他们坚信她是\N{\fs50}If they believe that she is then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:43.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们就可以得到我们想要的\N{\fs50}we get what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果她抽搐起来\N{\fs50}If she so much as twitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:55.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fs50}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:05.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吗？\N{\fs50}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:09.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:21.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,能给我把枪吗？\N{\fs50}Can I have a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 绝对不行 - 不可以\N{\fs50}-Absolutely not. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:26.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 老天 我朝他们扔他妈的三明治好了\N{\fs50}Okay, Jesus. Fine. I'll have to throw a fuckin' sandwich at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:45.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,外面安全\N{\fs50}It's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fs50}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:10.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哈 白天的外城看起来很不一样吧？\N{\fs50}Yeah, looks different in the daylight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:26.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fs50}We should get movin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:41.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看起来像是月球搞得一团糟的样子\N{\fs50}It's like a fucked-up moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:43.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是被他们炸的？\N{\fs50}Is this where they bombed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:44.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:46.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大多数大城市都被这么炸了\N{\fs50}They hit most of the big cities like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:49.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们得想办法阻止疫情蔓延\N{\fs50}They had to slow the spread somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:53.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这招在波士顿成功了 但在大多数地方都失败了\N{\fs50}Worked here, but it didn't in most places.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:04.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧 往前走就是州议会大厦\N{\fs50}So, the State House is across there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:07.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果直走 大概10分钟路程\N{\fs50}It's about a 10-minute walk if you could go straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:08.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么？\N{\fs50}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:09.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,选远路还是近路？\N{\fs50}Long way or short way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:13.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,恐怕是选远路 还是选那条“我们他妈死定了”的路\N{\fs50}I mean, it's the long way or the "we're fuckin' dead" way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:16.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,考虑到这条含糊的信息 我给远路投一票\N{\fs50}Well, I vote long way just based on that limited information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:20.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们得先去酒店那看看\N{\fs50}We have to check it from the hotel first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:22.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:42.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那些玩意儿究竟在哪？\N{\fs50}Where the fuck are they already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:44.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当他们靠近时 你会注意到的\N{\fs50}You'll know it when they're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:46.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上次我就没发现\N{\fs50}I didn't know last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么被咬的？\N{\fs50}How did you get bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,隔离区有个老购物中心 你听说过吗？\N{\fs50}You know the old mall in the QZ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说的是上了锁 封了门\N{\fs50}The one that's sealed off and boarded up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:57.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,根本不让进的那个？\N{\fs50}and no one's supposed to go in, ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是那地方吗？\N{\fs50}That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:00.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随便吧 反正我溜进去了\N{\fs50}Whatever. I snuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想看看里边是什么样子\N{\fs50}Wanted to see what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:05.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没想到那儿还有东西\N{\fs50}Didn't think there was gonna be anything in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:07.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有个家伙不知从哪儿窜出来冲向我\N{\fs50}and then one just came at me outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以为自己安全了 没想到\N{\fs50}Thought I got away, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你去的时候就你自己？\N{\fs50}So it was just you in there, alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:16.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:20.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你多大了？\N{\fs50}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,十四岁\N{\fs50}Fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:22.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fs50}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:26.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想说 你还挺有胆量的 小妹妹\N{\fs50}Well, I mean, you got some balls on you, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fs50}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:43.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人来找你吧？\N{\fs50}Nobody's gonna be comin' after you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:45.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比方说 你妈妈\N{\fs50}Like, Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:46.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fs50}Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:47.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,男朋友？\N{\fs50}boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:48.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是个孤儿\N{\fs50}I'm an orphan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:51.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且 也没男朋友\N{\fs50}and, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:58.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,每个人都跟我说 外城很可怕\N{\fs50}Everyone said the open city was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:02.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,差不多就是 成群结队的感染者随处可见\N{\fs50}Like, swarms of Infected running around everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:04.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不完全是那样\N{\fs50}Not exactly like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:06.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人们喜欢讲故事 你懂的\N{\fs50}You know, people like to tell stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.61,0:20:11.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也就是说 没有什么超级感染者往你身上炸真菌孢子？\N{\fs50}So, there aren't Super-Infected that explode fungus spores on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:13.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操 我倒希望不会有\N{\fs50}Shit, I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:17.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 有没有脑袋裂开的那种？跟蝙蝠似的 在黑暗中也能看见\N{\fs50}Or ones with split-open heads that see in the dark like bats?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:31.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么声音？\N{\fs50}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,继续往前走吧\N{\fs50}Let's keep movin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:16.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑！\N{\fs50}You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:18.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你俩曾经住过这地方？\N{\fs50}Ya ever stay in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:20.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 这儿太高级了\N{\fs50}No, a little out of our league.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:22.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这里是干嘛的？\N{\fs50}How do you even know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:23.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你难道没有听过书这种东西吗？\N{\fs50}Have you heard of books?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:27.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 我们要下水？\N{\fs50}Wait, are we going in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:30.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 得去另一侧的楼梯井\N{\fs50}Yeah, we gotta get to the stairwell on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:34.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呃 我不会游泳\N{\fs50}Well, I don't know how to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.61,0:21:36.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的假的？\N{\fs50}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:38.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得咱们那隔离区里会有游泳池？\N{\fs50}Do you think we have pools in the QZ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:39.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,聪明死你\N{\fs50}No, smart ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:40.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fs50}I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能知道\N{\fs50}I don't know how I was supposed to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:58.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fs50}This is so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:02.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快来看！\N{\fs50}Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,叮 叮\N{\fs50}Ding, ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:13.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是的先生 我要你们最好的套房 谢谢\N{\fs50}Yes, sir. I would like your finest suite, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:15.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好的女士 需要我为您提行李吗？\N{\fs50}Yes, ma'am. Would you like me to take your luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.99,0:22:18.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好的女士 马上来 女士——\N{\fs50}Yes, ma'am. Right away, ma'am--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:19.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你真是个怪小孩\N{\fs50}You're a weird kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:21.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你才是怪小孩\N{\fs50}You're a weird kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fs50}Oh fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:27.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fs50}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:33.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fs50}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.27,0:22:47.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fs50}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.37,0:22:50.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事 好他妈极了\N{\fs50}Yep. Fucking fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:07.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操 要人命了\N{\fs50}Fuck. Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:09.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得了 没那么糟吧\N{\fs50}Come on, it wasn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:11.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你用我们的膝盖爬他妈十层试试\N{\fs50}You try climbing ten fuckin' floors with our knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:12.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看看你啥感觉\N{\fs50}See how ya feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.05,0:23:25.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈啥时候变这样了？\N{\fs50}Well, when the fuck did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:33.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没准那扇能行\N{\fs50}Maybe that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:36.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吧 我觉着 也许我可以爬上去\N{\fs50}All right, well, I mean, maybe I could climb up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:42.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,探探路 然后从里边开门？\N{\fs50}work my way around, and open it from the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.37,0:23:45.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别 我个子最小 所以我爬过去最容易\N{\fs50}No, well, I'm the smallest, so it'd be easier for me to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要死了我们就白忙活了 你留下来\N{\fs50}But you die and we get nothing. You stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:50.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来帮我一把？\N{\fs50}Can you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:11.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上边没问题吧？\N{\fs50}You good up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:17.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没问题 但有点乱 我可能需要几分钟\N{\fs50}Yeah, it's a bit of a mess, so I'm gonna need a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.10,0:24:50.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好刀\N{\fs50}Nice knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.61,0:24:56.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这招你哪儿学的？\N{\fs50}Where'd you learn to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.79,0:24:58.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马戏团呀\N{\fs50}The circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:13.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是哪里人？\N{\fs50}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.00,0:25:15.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,德克萨斯\N{\fs50}Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:18.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝呢？\N{\fs50}What about Tess?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.02,0:25:19.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,底特律 在密歇根州\N{\fs50}Detroit. It's in Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.92,0:25:22.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我上过学 我知道底特律在哪儿\N{\fs50}I go to school. I know where Detroit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.64,0:25:30.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 你俩是——\N{\fs50}So, you two like a--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.43,0:25:31.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过\N{\fs50}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:33.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是怎么到波士顿来的？\N{\fs50}How'd you end up in Boston?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.79,0:25:34.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过\N{\fs50}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.27,0:25:36.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别再问我的事了\N{\fs50}No more questions about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.69,0:25:45.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感染者能活多久？\N{\fs50}How long do Infected live?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.15,0:25:46.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还以为你上过学呢\N{\fs50}I thought you went to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.53,0:25:48.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我那学校傻逼得很\N{\fs50}It's a really shitty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.24,0:25:53.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有的能活一两个月\N{\fs50}Well, some last about a month or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.91,0:25:57.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但也有游荡了20年左右的\N{\fs50}But there's others been walkin' around 'bout 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.88,0:26:03.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你杀过吗？\N{\fs50}Ever kill one?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:05.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我杀过很多\N{\fs50}Yeah, I killed lots of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:11.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,难下手吗？\N{\fs50}Was it hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.06,0:26:14.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,毕竟 你会想 他们曾经是人\N{\fs50}Like, knowing they were people once?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.10,0:26:19.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有时候吧\N{\fs50}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.40,0:26:23.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,昨晚那个人呢？\N{\fs50}What about that guy last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.16,0:26:31.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪放下 乔尔\N{\fs50}Put the gun down, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.38,0:26:42.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fs50}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.55,0:27:30.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,居然这么多\N{\fs50}There's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.43,0:27:33.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上次我们来这儿 它们还在大楼内部深处\N{\fs50}The last time we were here, they were still deep inside the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.22,0:27:35.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜后来跑来找隔离区的人太多了\N{\fs50}Then I guess enough people came through looking for the QZ,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.85,0:27:38.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们进到大楼里 找地方躲着\N{\fs50}they went inside seeking shelter,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:42.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,于是感染者一点一点 一年一年地蚕食掉这座城市\N{\fs50}and that's how they get more and more of the city bit by bit, year after year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.03,0:27:54.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它们彼此相连\N{\fs50}They're connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.37,0:27:56.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,程度比你以为得更紧密\N{\fs50}More than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.54,0:27:59.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真菌也生长在地下\N{\fs50}The fungus also grows underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.87,0:28:03.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,像电线一样长的纤维 有的能延伸到一英里外\N{\fs50}Long fibers like wires, some of them stretching over a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.67,0:28:06.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要是踩到了一个地方的线虫草菌\N{\fs50}Now, you step on a patch of cordyceps in one place,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.59,0:28:10.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许就能唤醒别处十几个感染者\N{\fs50}and you can wake a dozen Infected from somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.84,0:28:13.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它们知道了你的位置 就都过来了\N{\fs50}Now they know where you are, now they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.47,0:28:16.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的免疫能力可挡不住他们把你大卸八块\N{\fs50}You're not immune from being ripped apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:19.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fs50}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.48,0:28:21.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这很重要\N{\fs50}It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.69,0:28:24.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在教你保命\N{\fs50}I'm tryin' to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.65,0:28:33.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我们不走那边\N{\fs50}So we're not goin' that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.49,0:28:35.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.16,0:28:38.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办？\N{\fs50}What do we do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.70,0:28:41.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走近路？\N{\fs50}Short way?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.13,0:28:46.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走博物馆\N{\fs50}Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.57,0:29:09.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈是在开玩笑吧\N{\fs50}You've gotta be fucking kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:12.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,楼顶有条路能过去\N{\fs50}Well, there's a way across from the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.99,0:29:14.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊 你们说行就行\N{\fs50}Well, then I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.49,0:29:15.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这条路我们常走\N{\fs50}We used to take it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.64,0:29:16.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:17.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 这路没问题\N{\fs50}Look, it was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.81,0:29:19.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fs50}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.25,0:29:31.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干透了\N{\fs50}It's bone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:34.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能里边的都死光了\N{\fs50}It could mean they're all finally dead in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.31,0:29:41.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fs50}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.43,0:29:44.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳给你带了这个吗\N{\fs50}Marlene pack you one of these
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.85,0:29:46.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是只装了三明治？\N{\fs50}or just sandwiches?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:46.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带了\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.23,0:29:50.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 还有几条规矩\N{\fs50}Okay, so, more ground rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.73,0:29:52.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们动作要慢\N{\fs50}We're gonna go slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:54.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我们遇着了什么东西 你躲在我们身后\N{\fs50}If we come up against anything, you get behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.15,0:29:55.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在原地待好 行吗？\N{\fs50}and ya stay there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:56.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:03.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我空出来了一只手\N{\fs50}I have a spare hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.54,0:30:05.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,恭喜你啊\N{\fs50}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.50,0:30:33.38,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\c&H777261\fs120\b1\frz355.1\frx4\fry4\pos(907.2,902.8)}波士顿博物馆\N欢迎您
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.10,0:30:43.85,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\fs108\fn宋体\b1\frx356\fry0\pos(350.4,454.8)}出\N口
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:54.11,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hd4e5e1\fn宋体\b1\fs50\pos(1724.8,246.8)\frz356.5}波士顿博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:54.11,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hd4e5e1\fn宋体\b1\fs80\frz357.8\pos(1683.2,734.8)}礼品店\N营业中\N欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.51,0:31:01.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 死透了\N{\fs50}Yeah, cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.85,0:31:04.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,总算有点狗屎运\N{\fs50}Finally, some fuckin' luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.85,0:31:07.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,早知道我们一开始就走这边了\N{\fs50}I guess we should've gone this way in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.23,0:31:10.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fs50}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.07,0:31:17.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈什么东西干的？\N{\fs50}What the fuck did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.74,0:31:24.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能\N{\fs50}Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.70,0:31:29.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能他在外面受的袭击 然后爬进门里\N{\fs50}maybe he was attacked outside, and crawled through the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.12,0:31:31.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,门是开的 也许就是他\N{\fs50}The door was open. Could've been him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:33.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我什么都没听到\N{\fs50}I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.94,0:31:35.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会听到什么？\N{\fs50}Who would you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.21,0:31:39.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会听到什么？\N{\fs50}Who would you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.51,0:31:41.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是说这是感染者干的？\N{\fs50}Are you saying an Infected did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.64,0:31:45.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我被感染者袭击过 但不是这样的\N{\fs50}Because I've been attacked by one and it wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:51.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 从现在开始 我们要完全无声\N{\fs50}Okay, from this point forward, we are silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.85,0:31:53.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是安静 完全无声\N{\fs50}Not quiet. Silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.02,0:31:54.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么——\N{\fs50}What--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.71,0:31:57.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别 别问问题 只管照做\N{\fs50}No. No questions. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.93,0:33:34.14,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注,,0,0,0,,{\frz359.4\c&H625f2f\fn宋体\b1\fs50\pos(936,389.2)}独立展厅
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.61,0:35:32.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它们看不见 但能听到\N{\fs50}They can't see, but they can hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.19,0:36:09.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fs50}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.79,0:36:27.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跑 快跑！\N{\fs50}Run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.38,0:39:11.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fs50}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.19,0:39:14.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,脚踝扭了 但问题不大\N{\fs50}Twisted ankle, but, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.97,0:39:19.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fs50}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.47,0:39:22.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 我没尿裤子 所以 还行\N{\fs50}Well, I didn't shit my pants, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.89,0:39:26.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈逗我吗？\N{\fs50}You fucking kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.64,0:39:31.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果咱仨里非得有个人被咬 那就这样吧\N{\fs50}I mean, if it was gonna happen to one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.23,0:39:35.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs50}Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.40,0:39:37.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱快他妈离开这儿吧\N{\fs50}let's get the fuck outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.88,0:39:57.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,缠你胳膊上\N{\fs50}Put this around your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.24,0:39:58.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fs50}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.38,0:40:02.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走过去？\N{\fs50}Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.16,0:40:03.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对的 我知道 看着挺吓人\N{\fs50}Yeah, I know. It looks scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.05,0:40:06.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,刚刚才叫吓人 这是块木板而已\N{\fs50}That was scary. This is wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.85,0:40:12.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在那儿等着 等我们一会儿\N{\fs50}Just wait there. Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.41,0:40:25.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,前边估计还有更多\N{\fs50}There's probably more ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.33,0:40:27.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我们到时候再处理\N{\fs50}So, we'll deal with it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.83,0:40:30.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我来吧 我来\N{\fs50}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.54,0:40:36.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那小孩怎么办？\N{\fs50}What about the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.34,0:40:38.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 也许第一次被咬没感染\N{\fs50}I mean, maybe the first bite didn't take,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.42,0:40:39.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那这第二次呢？\N{\fs50}but what about the second?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.40,0:40:41.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就不能看着点好？\N{\fs50}How 'bout you just take the good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.34,0:40:43.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行吗？\N{\fs50}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.14,0:40:47.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这次你就不能好好想想 我们或许真有机会成功？\N{\fs50}Like to think, for once, maybe we could actually win?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.22,0:40:51.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过去吧 过去看着她\N{\fs50}Just go, go and watch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.04,0:41:17.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这一切都如你所愿吗？\N{\fs50}Is it everything you hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.88,0:41:20.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还不好说\N{\fs50}Jury's still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.63,0:41:25.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但老兄 这景色绝了\N{\fs50}But, man, you can't deny that view.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.98,0:41:34.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧 咱得在天黑之前到\N{\fs50}C'mon, let's get there before it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.60,0:42:53.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们他妈在哪儿呢？\N{\fs50}Where the fuck are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.64,0:43:35.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,待着别动\N{\fs50}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.51,0:44:09.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.80,0:44:11.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈怎么回事？\N{\fs50}What the fuck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.49,0:44:12.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fs50}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.14,0:44:19.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们进去了\N{\fs50}They went inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.90,0:44:25.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 泰丝\N{\fs50}-Come on. -Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.15,0:44:26.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fs50}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.32,0:44:27.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝！\N{\fs50}Tess!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.87,0:44:40.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fs50}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.00,0:44:44.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs50}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.76,0:44:54.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.84,0:44:58.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说 这儿肯定有他妈的收音机之类的 对吧？\N{\fs50}I mean, there's gotta be a fuckin' radio or somethin', right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.60,0:45:03.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谁杀了他们？FEDRA的人？\N{\fs50}Who killed them? FEDRA?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.56,0:45:05.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.94,0:45:09.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们当中有人被咬了\N{\fs50}One of them got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.65,0:45:11.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,健康的跟病了的打了起来 所有人都输了\N{\fs50}The healthy ones fought the sick ones. Everyone lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.69,0:45:14.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝？你在干嘛？\N{\fs50}Tess? What're you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.78,0:45:17.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳说要带你到哪儿去？\N{\fs50}Where did Marlene say that she was taking you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.49,0:45:18.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.06,0:45:19.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道 只说在西边\N{\fs50}I don't know. Just west.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.04,0:45:21.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是西边 他妈的 行吧\N{\fs50}Just west. Fuck. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.70,0:45:25.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 我是说 他们中间肯定有人身上有地图 对吧？\N{\fs50}Well, I mean, one of them's gotta have a map on them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:26.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 你能帮把手吗？\N{\fs50}Joel, can ya help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.73,0:45:27.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不能！\N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.88,0:45:30.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,泰丝 结束了\N{\fs50}Tess, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.55,0:45:31.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们现在回家\N{\fs50}We are going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.99,0:45:34.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那他妈不是我的家！\N{\fs50}That's not my fucking home!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.77,0:45:50.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要留下来\N{\fs50}I'm stayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.78,0:45:55.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 我们的好运迟早会用完\N{\fs50}I mean, our luck had to run out sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.32,0:45:58.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.83,0:46:01.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她被感染了\N{\fs50}She's infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.54,0:46:10.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让我看一下\N{\fs50}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.59,0:46:13.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.10,0:46:28.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真惨 对吧？\N{\fs50}Oops, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.57,0:46:38.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把你的绷带取下来\N{\fs50}Take your bandage off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.04,0:46:45.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.83,0:46:46.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看见了么？\N{\fs50}Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.88,0:46:50.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fs50}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.34,0:46:52.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 她是真他妈的免疫\N{\fs50}Joel, she's fucking real.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.67,0:46:57.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要你把她送到比尔和弗兰克那儿去\N{\fs50}I need you to get her to Bill and Frank's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.34,0:46:58.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 他们会从你那儿接手她\N{\fs50}-No. -They'll take her off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.89,0:47:00.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 之后他们来操心\N{\fs50}-No. -They'll handle it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.26,0:47:01.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不行 他们不会接手的\N{\fs50}No, no, no, I can't. They won't take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.55,0:47:02.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们不会接收她的\N{\fs50}They're not gonna take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.45,0:47:03.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们会 因为你会说服他们\N{\fs50}They will 'cause you'll convince them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.89,0:47:05.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fs50}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.10,0:47:06.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从没有要求过你什么\N{\fs50}I never ask you for anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.02,0:47:08.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 没要你回馈感情 - 不行\N{\fs50}-not to feel the way I felt. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.65,0:47:10.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把嘴他妈闭上 因为我没时间了\N{\fs50}Shut the fuck up 'cause I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.02,0:47:12.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是你的机会\N{\fs50}This is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.57,0:47:15.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你送她过去\N{\fs50}You get her there,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.82,0:47:17.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你保她活命\N{\fs50}you keep her alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.36,0:47:21.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就能重回正道\N{\fs50}and you set everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.29,0:47:25.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可是做过了那么多破事\N{\fs50}All the shit we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.70,0:47:28.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托你答应 乔尔 求你了\N{\fs50}Please say yes, Joel, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.50,0:47:30.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fs50}Oh fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.30,0:48:21.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有多少？\N{\fs50}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.07,0:48:21.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,全都来了\N{\fs50}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.80,0:48:22.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,顶多一分钟到\N{\fs50}Maybe a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.11,0:48:37.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fs50}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.09,0:48:38.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确保他们追不上你们\N{\fs50}Making sure that they don't follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.62,0:48:53.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.71,0:48:59.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,救你能救的人\N{\fs50}Save who you can save.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.22,0:49:09.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.68,0:49:11.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下她！\N{\fs50}We're not leaving her!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.77,0:49:13.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放开我 你个混蛋！\N{\fs50}Get off me, you fucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.52,0:49:14.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不要跟你走！\N{\fs50}I'm not going with you!
